Third-party components
================================================================================

Fetched at build time, not distributed here
-------------------------------------------

scripts/setup.sh clones these; they are not vendored in this repository:

  AFL++        https://github.com/AFLplusplus/AFLplusplus     Apache-2.0
  grmtools     https://github.com/softdevteam/grmtools        Apache-2.0 OR MIT

The files under patches/ are modifications to those projects and are governed
by the respective project's licence, not by the Apache-2.0 grant above.

examples/quickstart/run.sh downloads and builds LuaJIT (https://luajit.org,
MIT) at run time. It is not distributed here.

Grammars
--------

  grammars/*/custom.{l,y}
      Ported to Lex/Yacc from the Nautilus project's bug-finding grammars,
      https://github.com/nautilus-fuzz/nautilus (MIT licence).

  grammars/lua/standard.{l,y}, grammars/php/standard.{l,y}
      Derived from the lrpar grammar collection,
      https://github.com/softdevteam/grammars.

  grammars/ruby/standard.{l,y}, grammars/js/standard.{l,y}
      Written for this project, based on published BNF descriptions of the
      respective languages.

  grammars/*/corpus.{l,y}
      Derived from the standard grammars above, modified for this project.
